{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25250","headline":"和严揆省中宿斋遇令狐员外当直之作 · 李逢吉","name":"和严揆省中宿斋遇令狐员外当直之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"致斋分直宿南宫，越石卢谌此夜同。\n位极班行犹念旧，名题章奏亦从公。\n曾驱爪士三边静，新赠髯参六义穷。\n竟夕文昌知有月，可怜如在庾楼中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李逢吉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}